THIRD-PARTY DATA (added in v2.0)

The CC BY 4.0 licence above covers the author's own work. Data obtained from
third parties keep their own terms:

  - Data derived from OpenStreetMap (village coordinates from Nominatim, the
    control-village lists in data/processed/*control* and outputs extracted
    for those villages) are © OpenStreetMap contributors and available under
    the Open Database License (ODbL 1.0): https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  - Satellite-derived values contain modified Copernicus Sentinel data (ESA)
    and NOAA/EOG VIIRS data, accessed through Google Earth Engine.
  - Dynamic World (CC BY 4.0) and Google Open Buildings (CC BY 4.0 / ODbL)
    are used under their respective licences.
  - Natural Earth boundary lines are in the public domain.
